nΜις Πέρεγκριν: Στέγη για ασυνήθιστα παιδιά (Μις Πέρεγκριν, #1)"�
�Mesa apo ta paidika matia tes Skaout kai tou Tzem Phints, e Kharper Le exereuna me anantirrete entimoteta kai asteireuto khioumor ton paralogismo tes stases ton enelikon apenanti stis phuletikes kai koinonikes diakriseis ston Amerikaniko Noto tes dekaetias tou '30.
Ta phainomenika galenio kai eireniko Meikomp tes Alampama einai sten pragmatikoteta boutegmeno sten prokatalepse, te bia kai ten upokrisia. Alla te narkomene suneidese tes poles tha suntaraxei to sthenos enos anthropou pou agonizetai gia dikaiosune..."�
�Den mporo na sas po t' onoma mou, giati den ekho onoma. Eimai gonos mias arkhaias ratsas.
Eimai daimonistes. Ki aute einai e istoria mou...
Etsi xekina e aphegese enos anthropou pou den einai akribos anthropos. Enos plasmatos pou zei me diaphores morphes anamesa mas. To problema kai tautokhrona e kolase tou einai o erotas.
Gi' auton klebei, gi' auton skotonei, gi' auton buthizetai diarkos sten athlioteta. E istoria tou diabazetai san agrio thriler e san apisteuto bebelo khroniko. Omos piso apo tis suggraphikes epinoeseis pou upodaulizoun entekhna mian atmosphaira musteriou, agonias alla kai apognoses, O daimonistes apotimatai protista os mia bathia stokhastike anazetese ton orion kai ton diastaseon tes erotikes epithumias. Os ena biblio phantasias pou photagogei adiakrita tis skoteines atrapous tes edones, ekei opou thrummatizetai alla kai anasuntithetai kathe phora e anthropine upostase."�
�Ena musteriodes nesi. Ena egkataleimmeno orphanotropheio. Mia perierge sulloge apo polu paraxenes photographies.
Ola anamenoun na anakaluphthoun sto Mis Peregkrin - Stege gia Asunethista Paidia, ena axekhasto muthistorema pou anameignuei te logotekhnia kai te photographia se mia sunarpastike anagnostike empeiria. Sto xekinema tes istorias mas, mia phobere oikogeneiake tragodia othei ton dekaexakhrono Tzeikomp na taxidepsei se ena apomonomeno nesi konta stis aktes tes Oualias opou anakaluptei ta katarreonta khalasmata tes Steges gia Asunethista Paidia tes Mis Peregkrin. Kathos o Tzeikomp exereuna ta egkataleimmena upnodomatia kai tous diadromous, suneidetopoiei oti ta paidia etan kati perissotero apo apla asunethista. Mporei na etan epikinduna. Mporei na briskontan se karantina se ena eremonesi gia sostous logous. Kai me kapoio tropo -oso adianoeto ki an phainetai- mporei na einai akome zontana."�
�Ena kalo diegema, elege o Khemingkoueu, prepei na einai san pagobouno: to tmema tou pou phainetai na einai panta mikrotero ap' auto pou menei aorato kato apo to nero kai prosdidei entase, musterio, duname kai noema s' auto pou pleei sten epiphaneia. Ta dekatessera diegemata autou tou bibliou akolouthoun auto ton kanona, eno sugkhronos trophodotountai apo ena allo reuma mesa sto opoio pleei o suggrapheas tous: e muthoplasia einai o kathrephtes tes pragmatikotetas. Kai pragmati auto sumbainei, toulakhiston sto diko tou logotekhniko sumpan: aphegemata anoikhta, entelos aproblepta, opou auto pou brisketai pera apo ten -pantote sunarpastike- existorese, to ainigma pou prepei na apokaluphthei, pantote upophoskei tou graptou, skhematizontas kathe phora mia eikona eggegrammene sten uphanse tou khaliou, mia eikona ten opoia kaloumaste na apokalupsoume, enan topo opou pragmatikoteta kai muthoplasia mimountai e mia ten alle.
O Sensini, enas elikiomenos, exoristos Latinoamerikanos suggrapheas, didaskei se enan neotero tou suggraphea, ki auton ekpatrismeno, te strategike ton eparkhiakon logotekhnikon brabeion... E Tzoanna Silbestri, palia ntiba tou pornographikou kinematographou, arroste se mia klinike tes Nim, thumatai ton erota tes gia ton Tzak, palio sumprotagoniste tes, pou pethane apo AIDS... Sto Anri Simon Leprens o Mpolanio aphegeitai ten peripeteia, se taragmenous kairous, enos suggraphea khoris talento, pou omos zei gia te logotekhnia... E Kampia einai enas antras monima kathismenos se kapoio apo ta pagkakia tes Alameda, sten Pole tou Mexikou, pantote oplismenos, pou mila oles tis glosses ton Mexikanon ithagenon, kai mia mera leei pos katagetai apo ena khorio dolophonon kai goeteuei enan ephebo pou ekhei molis arkhisei na drapeteuei apo te sumbatike zoe... O Ouilliam Mparns, enas esukhos Amerikanos apo te Notia Kaliphornia, brisketai mplegmenos se mia istoria erotikon trigonon kai astokhon dolophonion...
Aphegeseis gemates apoekhous kai anaphores se alles aphegeseis, thrausmata biographion kai autobiographion me ta opoia o Romperto Mpolanio sunthetei ena asteio kai sugkinetiko pazl, upenthumizontas mas ton ainigmatiko kharaktera tes anthropines katastases."�

�
To 1969 e zographos Emma Regies esteile ston philo tes istoriko Kherman Arsiniegas ten prote apo tis eikosi treis epistoles pou perigraphoun tis skleres sunthekes mesa stis opoies kulese e paidike tes elikia. O philos tes sugklonisteke apo tis epodunes autes anamneseis ki apophasise na deixei ta keimena ston Gkampriel Gkarsia Markes, o opoios entharrune te Regies na sunekhisei to grapsimo. E allelographia kratese os to 1997* s' auto to diastema, o Arsiniegas kataphere na parei ten egkrise tes Emma Regies gia na ekdosei tis epistoles meta ton thanato tes.
Me mia graphe pou xekhorizei gia ten entimoteta kai ten apousia kathe epitedeuses, e Regies aphegeitai tis antixootetes ton paidikon tes khronon sten Kolombia stis arkhes tou 20ou aiona, otan ten egkateleipsan mazi me ten aderphe tes s' ena monasteri. Khoris autolupese, me euphuIa enelikou kai matia koritsiou, kataphernei na metadosei me akribeia ston anagnoste ta sunaisthemata tes.
Mia realistike kai empneusmene perigraphe tou pos kapoios mporei na anaduthei apo athlies sunthekes kai na xekhorisei.
Kirkus Reviews
Oi anagnostes, kathos diabazoume tis Anamneseis di' allelographias, epises megalonoume apotoma, opos e Emma Regies, kai khamogelame.
El Pais
Ena kataplektiko keimeno pou, perissotero apo pote, einai e idia e zoe.
ABC Cultural"�
�Ena agori. Ena koritsi pou zographizei sto khioni.
Enas erotas pou gennietai. Mia koinonia pou krubetai. Ena makhairi pou kobei. Mia agape peloria, pou lampei."�
�Sta anoikhta tes Kornouales brisketai ena mikro idiotiko nesi. Enas mikros st' aletheia paradeisos, aphou to idruma sto opoio anekei to ekhei metatrepsei se oase galenes kai asphaleias gia anthropous me upsela kathekonta, prothupourgous, epistemones, kallitekhnes, megaloepikheirematies klp. S' aute omos ten oase brisketai nekros, apagkhonismenos sto kigklidoma tou paliou pharou, o phemismenos suggrapheas Neithan Oliber. Egklema e autoktonia; E upothese einai duskole. Apaitei amesous kai leptous kheirismous oste na epiluthei to gregorotero dunaton, dedomenou oti to nesi ekhei epilegei apo ton idio ton prothupourgo tes M. Bretanias gia na pragmatopoiethei ekei mustike Sunantese Koruphes. To dusepiluto musterio erkhetai na ginei akoma pio skoteino me ena deutero phono, mia epidemike astheneia kai tis apeiles kata tes zoes tou astunomou Ntagklis.
E gnoste atmosphaira tes megales <>tou astunomikou muthistorematos, me tis uperokhes perigraphes ton khoron kai to aristotekhniko smileuma ton kharakteron, kanoun ton Pharo ena apo ta pio endiapheronta muthistoremata tou eidous."�
�To telephono khtupa epimona sto spiti tou elikiomenou suggraphea Zan Ntaragkan. Enas agnostos thelei na tou epistrepsei te khamene tou atzenta.
O Ntaragkan tha sunantesei ton agnosto se kapoio kaphe kai apo ekeine te stigme tha xekinesei mia poreia pros to parelthon. E mneme tha ton gurisei sten epaurio tes Katokhes me te skoteine atmosphaira, opou o eptakhronos tote Zan Ntaragkan, paratemenos apo te metera tou, zei khare stis phrontides enos kuklou mikrokakopoion, tzogadoron kai koritsion ton parizianikon kampare, kurios omos tes eikosiduakhrones Anni Astran, koritsiou ton perithoriakon nukhterinon kentron, pou tha stoikheiosei te zoe tou me ena ateleioto paikhnidi apotheseon to opoio arkhizei ta prota khronia tes dekaetias tou 1950 kai teleionei to kalokairi tou 2013.
E skenographia philm nouar kai to Parisi den leipoun ki ap' auto to biblio tou Patrik Montiano, opos epises to basanistiko aisthema mias asuneidetes enokhes pou kollaei san metadotike arrostia pano sto paidi pou megalose stis paruphes tes Istorias kai nanouristeke apo misologa dosilogon, parizianon phtokhodiabolon kai maphiozon me truphere kardia.
Ta stoikheia, oi khronologies, ta toponumia, ta onomata ton dromon pou paratithentai, den arkoun gia na anaduthei olokleromeno to parelthon, kai e biomene pragmatikoteta paramenei abebaie, musteriodes, kapote apeiletike. Omos o Montiano to eikhe pei prokatabolika: "Den mporo na doso ten pragmatikoteta ton gegonoton, mporo na parousiaso mono te skia tous"."	
